            "step": 5,
            "action": "Ensure the 1-minute price has swept some liquidity before tapping into the higher timeframe FVG or 15-minute FVG.",
            "rationale": "This is a liquidity sweep check."
          },
          {
            "step": 6,
            "action": "Wait for the 1-minute price to close below the FVG (for a bullish FVG) or above the FVG (for a bearish FVG), creating an inversion.",
            "rationale": "Inversion is when price disrespect[s] the FVG and closes on the opposite side, turning the FVG into resistance/support."
